{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"Items Available:\n\nAirhead ale: This drink makes you feel light of both head and body. For the next hour, you levitate 5ft off of the ground at your walking speed, and descend at a rate of 5ft every 30ft if more than 5ft off of the ground. However, you find it hard to focus, and have disadvantage on saving throws to maintain concentration. 120gp.\n\nBegger's Bottle: This drink allows you to use the \"Grovel and Beg\" racial feature of Kobolds once in the next hour. 260gp.\n\nBanshee's Brew: This dark grey drink seems to wail mournfully at a low volume. Once during the next day, you can emit a mournful wail. ALL creatures within 30 feet of you must make a wisdom saving throw or take psychic damage equal to 2d8 plus your Charisma modifier. If you warn your allies ahead of time, they have advantage on this saving throw. 270gp.\nWine of Whimsy: This dark purple drink made from grapes causes the drinker to giggle for the next hour when not otherwise speaking, making them seem like less of a threat. Attacks against you have disadvantage if you have not damaged an enemy or used a negative effect on one this combat. 140gp.","created_at":"2021-07-10T05:14:38.963000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T18:58:54.582000Z","id":"863287079970406400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"852746193813766144","content":"Cizzle Cider: This drink container is home to a small fire elemental, and can either be drank to give you resistance to fire damage for the next ten minutes, or can be smashed against the ground, causing each creature within 10 feet of the item to make a DC 16 Dexterity saving throw or take 14 (4d6) fire damage. 500gp.\n\nThe Floral Ferment: This drink is sweet-smelling and enticing, giving you advantage on persuasion and deception checks for the next hour due to the sweet smell and charming demeanor it gives the drinker. 220gp.\n\nGrasping Guinness: When drank, this beverage makes your unarmed strikes have a reach of 15 feet and pull the target up to 10 feet closer to you on a successful hit as your arms elongate and become rubbery for the next hour. 370gp.\n\nLurching Leprechaun: This drink is constantly swirling and moving in the container. When drank, you gain the ability to take the disengage action as a bonus action as you sway around unpredictably. You also gain the ability to stand up from prone using only 5 feet of movement. These benefits last for 1 hour.160gp.","created_at":"2021-07-10T05:15:21.316000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T18:59:24.221000Z","id":"863287257611239434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
